  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe given expression = 40 ÷ 5 of 2 × [18 ÷ 6 × (12 − 9) of 5 − (3 − 8)] ÷ 25\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n40 ÷ 5 of 2 × [18 ÷ 6 × (12 − 9) of 5 − (3 − 8)] ÷ 25\n\n= 40 ÷ 10 × [18 ÷ 6 × 3 of 5 − (- 5)] ÷ 25\n\n= 4 × [18 ÷ 6 × 3 of 5 + 5] ÷ 25\n\n= 4 × [18 ÷ 6 × 15 + 5] ÷ 25\n\n= 4 × [3 × 15 + 5] ÷ 25\n\n= 4 × [45 + 5] ÷ 25\n\n= 4 × 50 ÷ 25\n\n= 4 × 2\n\n= 8\n\n**∴ The value of the expression is 8**",
